Package: ASMR
Type: Package
Title: Anchored Score-Matching Representative (ASMR) and Transformed Mean Representative (TMR)
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Keren Li [aut]
Author@R: 
    c(person(given = "Keren",
             family = "Li",
